                                "sense_id": "f3aca7f7-0703-3443-ae1e-66751c7c1a0f",
                                "text": "ну и денёк сего́дня зада́лся!",
                                "translation": "we have not had a day like this for a long time!",
                                "english": "we have not had a day like this for a long time!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
